          "content": {
            "id": "736e1892-e9a1-3b1b-8d06-151002e04e03",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Apple reportedly eyes a budget laptop, Denny's to go private",
            "description": "<p>Some of the stories Wall Street is watching on Tuesday, Nov. 4, include:</p>\n<p>Apple (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AAPL\">AAPL</a>) is preparing to launch a low-cost Mac laptop next year, according to a <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-11-04/apple-readies-a-low-cost-laptop-to-rival-chromebooks-and-windows-pcs\">report from Bloomberg</a>.</p>\n<p>Papa John's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PZZA\">PZZA</a>) shares are falling following a <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.reuters.com/business/finance/apollo-withdraws-bid-take-pizza-chain-papa-johns-private-64-share-sources-say-2025-11-04/\">Reuters report</a> that Apollo Global has pulled its offer to take the pizza chain private.</p>\n<p>Shares of Denny's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DENN\">DENN</a>) are soaring after agreeing to go private.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>\n<p><em>Editor's note: Apollo Global Management is the parent company of Yahoo Finance.</em></p>",
            "summary": "Some of the stories Wall Street is watching on Tuesday, Nov. 4, include: Apple (AAPL) is preparing to launch a low-cost Mac laptop next year, according to a report from Bloomberg. Papa John's (PZZA) shares are falling following a Reuters report that Apollo Global has pulled its offer to take the pizza chain private. Shares of Denny's (DENN) are soaring after agreeing to go private. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination. Editor's note: Apollo Global Management is the parent company of Yahoo Finance.",
